        "panel": {
          "introduction": "Ida is an elongated, heavily cratered asteroid in the Koronis family. Galileo flew past in 1993 and discovered its small moon Dactyl. The measured shape and Galileo mosaic reveal Ida’s uneven outline and impact-scarred surface.",
