                "path": "../manifest.json"
              },
              "falseColor": false,
              "detail": "Galileo SSI · processed image mosaic",
              "summary": "Photographed shadows remain and detail varies across the mosaic. Brightness is not calibrated reflectance; the grid marks gaps."
            },
            {
              "id": "calibrated",
              "label": "Calibrated image",
              "description": "Galileo’s 1993 green-filter image, calibrated to reflectance (I/F) and placed using the published shape and camera controls. Brightness retains the photographed illumination; it is not surface albedo. A fixed 0–0.12 I/F display range uses gamma 2.2. Bad detector pixels, uncertain edges and unobserved areas use the gray grid.",
